[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13082.469, "timestamp": "03:38:02", "text": "在合作直播期间，请百分百投入。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13085.429, "timestamp": "03:38:05", "text": "以及所有的一切。是的。所以你必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13087.51, "timestamp": "03:38:07", "text": "保持微笑之类的。那是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13089.67, "timestamp": "03:38:09", "text": "也是一样。即使存在冲突"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13091.83, "timestamp": "03:38:11", "text": "每当冲突发生时，我的天赋"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13094.15, "timestamp": "03:38:14", "text": "经理会到场终止谈判。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13096.71, "timestamp": "03:38:16", "text": "然后在这里解决这个问题。双方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13099.269, "timestamp": "03:38:19", "text": "取其中的中性部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13101.59, "timestamp": "03:38:21", "text": "了解问题所在并找到解决方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13104.469, "timestamp": "03:38:24", "text": "双方达成休战协议等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13108.309, "timestamp": "03:38:28", "text": "就是那种感觉，嗯，差不多就是这样。和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13110.469, "timestamp": "03:38:30", "text": "这也是至关重要的一点。如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13113.51, "timestamp": "03:38:33", "text": "想让其中一个离开吗？我有两个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13116.11, "timestamp": "03:38:36", "text": "一周时间。不是这个。这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13119.03, "timestamp": "03:38:39", "text": "重要的。很少有机构这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13121.75, "timestamp": "03:38:41", "text": "但这很好。记住，有些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13124.309, "timestamp": "03:38:44", "text": "机构、一些公司、企业"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13127.83, "timestamp": "03:38:47", "text": "在这个行业里，他们说你想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13130.95, "timestamp": "03:38:50", "text": "要离开，你放的不是这个，你确实这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13132.99, "timestamp": "03:38:52", "text": "法律方面的事情，你已经签字了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13136.07, "timestamp": "03:38:56", "text": "一切。公告仍然有效"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13139.83, "timestamp": "03:38:59", "text": "不会公开。人们会知道"}]